{"3071240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Voodoo Fishin'", "steam_appid": 3071240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voodoo Fishin’ is a 1–6 player online co-op creepy-cozy fishing game featuring proximity voice chat and swamp-dwelling surprises.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the bayou with friends in search of rare and legendary fish. The deeper you go, the stranger things get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish together. Laugh together. Try not to lose your haul. If you die, the swamp keeps your catch. (And any Tackle you have equipped) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/41d228ce70556a3826944980b3d19823.avif?t=1786740797\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/b4d02696b9a0b039f480548e78beefbd.poster.avif?t=1786740797\" width=780 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/b4d02696b9a0b039f480548e78beefbd.webm?t=1786740797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/b4d02696b9a0b039f480548e78beefbd.mp4?t=1786740797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Craft your puppet angler and hit the dock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/ee61859be86ae4aaed5fa247ee23eae3.avif?t=1786740797\" width=780 height=71 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/d5b319d38c7e34c6753e58967393e777.poster.avif?t=1786740797\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/d5b319d38c7e34c6753e58967393e777.webm?t=1786740797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/d5b319d38c7e34c6753e58967393e777.mp4?t=1786740797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> It’s chill… until it isn’t. This swamp hunts back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/6801e59d9932e35224044242e8e3f672.avif?t=1786740797\" width=780 height=70 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/a10a7b74f376cfe224c83b6f5c193e66.poster.avif?t=1786740797\" width=780 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/a10a7b74f376cfe224c83b6f5c193e66.webm?t=1786740797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/a10a7b74f376cfe224c83b6f5c193e66.mp4?t=1786740797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>If you make it back alive, the Fish Monger pays by the pound.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/b1873fefcb378c5ec4fcb45100850852.avif?t=1786740797\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/37fe83f56901bfd5098b23ab97f7ca04.poster.avif?t=1786740797\" width=780 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/37fe83f56901bfd5098b23ab97f7ca04.webm?t=1786740797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/37fe83f56901bfd5098b23ab97f7ca04.mp4?t=1786740797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgrade your Bait, Reels, and Rods to chase bigger and rarer fish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Forever</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The swamp doesn’t run on corporate servers. Voodoo Fishin’ is <i>self-hosted</i>, so once you’re in, you can always jump back in with friends. No server shutdowns. No “service discontinued.”<br><br>The swamp stays open as long as you can stay alive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/8f50c029aaa88c79ddedf32f1ed36fbc.avif?t=1786740797\" width=780 height=71 /></span>The demo provides access to the full core gameplay systems, but limits world exploration and higher-tier Tackle.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voodoo Fishin’ is a 1–6 player online co-op creepy-cozy fishing game featuring proximity voice chat and swamp-dwelling surprises.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the bayou with friends in search of rare and legendary fish. The deeper you go, the stranger things get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish together. Laugh together. Try not to lose your haul. If you die, the swamp keeps your catch. (And any Tackle you have equipped) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/41d228ce70556a3826944980b3d19823.avif?t=1786740797\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/b4d02696b9a0b039f480548e78beefbd.poster.avif?t=1786740797\" width=780 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/b4d02696b9a0b039f480548e78beefbd.webm?t=1786740797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/b4d02696b9a0b039f480548e78beefbd.mp4?t=1786740797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Craft your puppet angler and hit the dock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/ee61859be86ae4aaed5fa247ee23eae3.avif?t=1786740797\" width=780 height=71 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/d5b319d38c7e34c6753e58967393e777.poster.avif?t=1786740797\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/d5b319d38c7e34c6753e58967393e777.webm?t=1786740797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/d5b319d38c7e34c6753e58967393e777.mp4?t=1786740797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_para